{"4637580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sky Runway", "steam_appid": 4637580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/aff6d23d211ffdb668a464829b37f6f4.avif?t=1787367697\" width=1280 height=302 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >During the eternal night, the stars will light your way.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking up, it seems you are the last survivor of your species. You don't remember anything, and all you have is your car and a long road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky Runway is a sci-fi game where you must drive your special vehicle through the streets of ruined space cities; gather everything you can without stopping, seek shelter, and use your abilities to defeat enemies controlled by powerful forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/24ef90b06ace1daf30c5142603d1d23a.poster.avif?t=1787367697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/24ef90b06ace1daf30c5142603d1d23a.webm?t=1787367697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/24ef90b06ace1daf30c5142603d1d23a.mp4?t=1787367697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dangerous grid structures in the space-built cities of the Alaknanda galaxy in search of answers about your crew and other strange events that brought you here, doing everything you can to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/a58d820477097ad759bcc118717c4e42.avif?t=1787367697\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hunters will show you no mercy; they are very intelligent and will do anything to capture you. But you are not alone. Within the city, there are still good friends who will help and accompany you on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The space cities in Alaknanda are dangerous, but you have no other choice and must traverse them to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/c5471429f94a0f4d5c4edf255cb10673.poster.avif?t=1787367697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/c5471429f94a0f4d5c4edf255cb10673.webm?t=1787367697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/c5471429f94a0f4d5c4edf255cb10673.mp4?t=1787367697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful tools, traps, and ever-expanding mechanisms to defeat your enemies and take your exploration even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over 14 paths filled with dangers and challenges within a colossal space structure built for the fastest cars and the most adventurous souls. The structures contain artifacts and resources you'll need on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive to the goal terminal and eliminate enemies along the way using your car's abilities. You can also increase your jump distance, speed, and damage resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the grand story surrounding the forgotten structures of the network as they descend into darkness and the destruction of star civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to build new cars, new tools, and acquire more abilities to aid you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the action-packed adventures presented in each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/e942ecd659d931d5a947d15d80b9cb9c.poster.avif?t=1787367697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/e942ecd659d931d5a947d15d80b9cb9c.webm?t=1787367697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/e942ecd659d931d5a947d15d80b9cb9c.mp4?t=1787367697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unparalleled adventure in a space filled with dangers and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the map and use the central terminals to go to the next location, and venture into its massive structures, but be careful, the hunters will be waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/6dd8f09ba7b8dadc7c6f9bb14caf9ae6.avif?t=1787367697\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras_big/6dd8f09ba7b8dadc7c6f9bb14caf9ae6.webp?t=1787367697 width=1560 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4637580/extras/fc523b90f342bded0ea9c69eaa1420c2.avif?t=1787367697\" 